---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure — Neo Mind Flow" description="How affiliate links work on Neo Mind Flow.">
  <main class="container page">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="updated"><em>Last updated: August 20, 2026</em></p>

    <p>
      Neo Mind Flow is reader-supported. When you buy through links on our Site, we
      may earn an affiliate commission at no additional cost to you.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong>
    </p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>
      Some of the books and products mentioned on the Site contain affiliate links.
      If you click one of these links and make a purchase, the retailer (for
      example, Amazon) pays us a small commission. The price you pay is unchanged.
    </p>

    <h2>Our editorial independence</h2>
    <p>
      Affiliate relationships do not influence our recommendations. Books are
      selected based on their quality, reputation, and usefulness — not on
      commission rates. When a book is recommended, it is because we believe it
      earns the recommendation.
    </p>

    <h2>Identifying affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Affiliate links on this Site are marked with
      <code>rel="sponsored nofollow"</code> and open in a new tab. A disclosure
      notice also appears at the top of articles that contain affiliate links.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you have any questions, visit our
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'contact/'}>contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .page h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }
  .page h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  code {
    font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
</style>
